"Assistant Model:\n"
"Responsible for AI author optimization (Sparkle ✨), text translations, and scene image prompts."
msgstr ""
"Model Asisten:\n"
"Bertanggung jawab atas optimasi penulis AI (Sparkle ✨), terjemahan teks, dan prompt gambar adegan."

#: flask/templates/admin/services.html:140
msgid ""
"Vision Model:\n"
"Multimodal model for visual analysis of persona portraits, 16:9 location images, and image uploads in chat."
msgstr ""
"Model Visi:\n"
"Model multimodal untuk analisis visual potret persona, gambar lokasi 16:9, dan unggahan gambar dalam obrolan."

